{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/115235","id":3197537964,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6-lo6s","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/115235","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/115235.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/115235.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115235","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/115235/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/115235/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115235/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/70ecd487f4638c3a0fe84ca8a375f406b970f60f","number":115235,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"`AudioStreamWAV::load_from_file`: Do not load file into memory","user":{"login":"DeeJayLSP","id":60024671,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYwMDI0Njcx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/60024671?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP","html_url":"https://github.com/DeeJayLSP","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Partly inspired by #96545 (this PR began as a split from that one before reducing its scope to the current state)\r\n\r\n#93831 repurposed WAV importing code so it could be used to load WAV files.\r\n\r\nIt had a side effect though: all WAV loading, including importing, loads the entire file data into memory to read, even if you use `load_from_file`:\r\n\r\n<img width=\"1267\" height=\"607\" alt=\"before\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/52215576-ee74-4f12-a9ae-4cb4a9f75050\" />\r\n\r\nI did some changes to separate the load procedure from `load_from_buffer`, so `load_from_file` could read from a `FileAccess` again. It's now something like this:\r\n\r\n<img width=\"2107\" height=\"790\" alt=\"after\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/47ec81cf-2f4a-4c98-8e8d-76482da47d8e\" />\r\n\r\nThe current code reads the file frame-by-frame, which is significantly slower when reading directly from file, so I borrowed a technique from `dr_wav` where it does so in chunks of 4KiB, which maintains the current read time.\r\n\r\nBy benchmarks below, this should minimize memory usage while keeping load times around the same.","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":572781997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw1NzI3ODE5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:audio","name":"topic:audio","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":3240950060,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwzMjQwOTUwMDYw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/performance","name":"performance","description":"","color":"447777","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":8237783,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AfbLX","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/miles